    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "France 24 reports that the COP31 climate talks in Turkey collapsed.",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:1075c80c2e70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "According to the United Nations, the conference collapsed on 22 November 2026, after two days of overtime negotiations.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387407495:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The 2026 United Nations Climate Change Conference, more commonly known as COP31, was held at the Expo Center in Antalya, Turkey.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387407495:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The conference is dated 2026, and it began on 9 November 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q115379423:P585",
        "wd:Q115379423:P580"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:52Z",
      "text": "France 24 headlined the story: “COP31 climate talks in Turkey collapse.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:1075c80c2e70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:58Z",
      "text": "BBC News asked what comes next after no deal at COP31 climate talks.",
      "cites": [
        "news:bbc:fcb85812f82b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:01:04Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera asked why the COP31 climate talks collapsed without a deal.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:b030418a4c24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:01:13Z",
